  "summary": "Clean and natural overall, as expected of the reference course. The main gap is that many past-tense and adjective answers accept only the masculine speaker form (сделал, хотел бы, местный, пошёл, думал, достиг), so female learners are marked wrong. There are also a few calques ('для меня', 'с ясными аргументами'), a missing comma, and four generic hints.",
